       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "20937701"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Guanine nucleotide exchange factor (GEF) which may activate RAB3A, a GTPase that regulates synaptic vesicle exocytosis. Promotes the exchange of GDP to GTP, converting inactive GDP-bound Rab proteins into their active GTP-bound form. May also activate RAB8A and RAB8B"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with RAB3A and IHPK1 through the coiled-coil domain. This interaction is competitive. IHPK1 kinase activity is not required for this interaction (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
